# Example agent tasks

- **Add utility:** export from package `index.ts` if public; JSDoc; tests; `yarn api-extractor` if public API changes
- **Fix test:** `yarn test-packages` or `cd packages/<name> && yarn test`; preserve intended behavior
- **Change template:** edit under `packages/create-content-sdk-app/src/templates/`; verify with `yarn watch` or `yarn scaffold-samples` + `npm run build`

Full workflows: [`.agents/docs/AGENTS-workflows.md`](../../.agents/docs/AGENTS-workflows.md)
